Package: varianceproject
Title: Patient Safety Variance Project (JHF/PRHI)
Version: 0.1.0
Description: Analysis project for hospital patient-safety variance. This
    DESCRIPTION exists to declare the dependency set explicitly, so that
    renv::snapshot(type = "explicit") records what the project intends to
    depend on rather than only what today's scripts happen to call. Stage 1
    (the ported Phase 0 drivers) deliberately uses none of these: it is base
    R, so it runs before the library is restored.
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    renv,
    jsonlite,
    readxl,
    data.table,
    mice,
    lme4,
    mclust,
    sf
